"في الكلام نختصر: نحذف أول حرف من be ونضع مكانه علامة.": "When we speak we use short forms: we drop the first letter of be and put an apostrophe.",
"not بعد be": "not after be",
"النفي: <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">not</span> بعد <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">be</span>. ومع <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">I</span> نقول <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">I'm not</span>.": "Negative: <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">not</span> after <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">be</span>. With <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">I</span> we say <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">I'm not</span>.",
"be في أول السؤال": "be first in a question",
