"أسماء أدوات المكتب (calculator، ruler، notepad، rubber، correction fluid، highlighter…)، ووصف شيء لا تعرف اسمه (It's a thing for …ing / It's stuff for … / It's something we use to …)، وحروف الجر للمكان (next to، under، on، in front of، near، behind).": "Office things (calculator, ruler, notepad, rubber, correction fluid, highlighter…), describing a thing when you don't know its name (It's a thing for …ing / It's stuff for … / It's something we use to …), and prepositions of place (next to, under, on, in front of, near, behind).",
"تتحدث عن الأشياء في المكتب. ستتعلم:": "You talk about the things in the office. You will learn:",
"أسماء أدوات المكتب.": "The names of office things.",
