"شرح القاعدة: أدوات المكتب، ووصف شيء لا تعرف اسمه، وحروف الجر للمكان <span class=\"ref\">ص 10–11</span>": "The rules: office things, describing a thing without its name, and prepositions of place <span class=\"ref\">pp. 10–11</span>",
"في هذا الدرس تتكلم عن أدوات مكتبك وأماكنها. نشرح أسماء الأدوات، ثم كيف تصف شيئاً نسيت اسمه، ثم حروف الجر التي تحدد مكانه.": "In this lesson you talk about the things on your desk and where they are. We explain their names, then how to describe a thing when you forget its name, then the prepositions that say where it is.",
"1. أدوات المكتب <span class=\"ref\">ص 10</span>": "1. Office things <span class=\"ref\">p. 10</span>",
"نبدأ بأسماء الأدوات التي على كل مكتب.": "We start with the names of the things on every desk.",
"بعض الأسماء تختلف بين البريطانية والأمريكية: <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">rubber (BrE) = eraser (AmE)</span>": "Some names are different in British and American English: <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">rubber (BrE) = eraser (AmE)</span>",
"ونسأل عن الأداة: <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">What's this?</span> والجواب <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">It's a stapler.</span>": "We ask about a thing: <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">What's this?</span> The answer: <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">It's a stapler.</span>",
"مختبر مصغّر: الوصف": "Mini lab: the description",
"2. وصف شيء لا تعرف اسمه <span class=\"ref\">ص 10</span>": "2. Describing a thing when you don't know its name <span class=\"ref\">p. 10</span>",
"كثيراً ما تحتاج شيئاً ولا تتذكر اسمه بالإنجليزي. عندها تصف ما يُستعمل له، وزميلك يعرفه.": "You often need a thing and can't remember its English name. Then you describe what we use it for, and your colleague knows it.",
"<span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">It's a thing for</span> + الفعل + <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">ing</span>: <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">It's a thing for adding numbers.</span>": "<span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">It's a thing for</span> + verb + <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">ing</span>: <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">It's a thing for adding numbers.</span>",
"<span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">It's something we use to</span> + الفعل كما هو: <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">It's something we use to draw a straight line.</span>": "<span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">It's something we use to</span> + verb with no change: <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">It's something we use to draw a straight line.</span>",
"<span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">It's stuff for</span> + الفعل + <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">ing</span> لما لا يُعد (سائل أو مادة): <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">It's stuff for correcting mistakes.</span>": "<span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">It's stuff for</span> + verb + <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">ing</span>, for something you can't count (a liquid or a material): <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">It's stuff for correcting mistakes.</span>",
