"الجهات (north، southeast…) والمواقع (in the centre، in the suburbs، in the country، on the east coast)، والتنقل للعمل (commute، commuter، teleworker)، والرغبة بـ would like to / wouldn't like to، وأماكن عمل الشركة (head office، branch office، factory، warehouse، showroom)، ووصف مواقعها.": "Compass points (north, southeast…) and places (in the centre, in the suburbs, in the country, on the east coast), travelling to work (commute, commuter, teleworker), wishes with would like to / wouldn't like to, company workplaces (head office, branch office, factory, warehouse, showroom), and describing where they are.",
"تصف أين تعيش وتعمل، وأين أماكن شركة. ستتعلم:": "You describe where you live and work, and where a company's workplaces are. You will learn:",
