"في هذا الدرس نصف أين نعمل ونسكن: مواقع المدن والجهات، ثم ما نحب أو لا نحب بـ <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">would like to</span>، ثم أماكن الشركة المختلفة.": "In this lesson we describe where we work and live: where cities are, then what we would or wouldn't like with <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">would like to</span>, then the different workplaces of a company.",
"1. المواقع والجهات <span class=\"ref\">ص 12</span>": "1. Places and compass points <span class=\"ref\">p. 12</span>",
"لنصف مكان مدينة أو مصنع نستعمل الجهات. ولكل منها حرف جر ثابت.": "To describe where a city or a factory is, we use compass points. Each one has a fixed preposition.",
"<span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">in</span> مع الوسط والجهات والضواحي: <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">in the centre · in the north · in the suburbs</span>": "<span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">in</span> with the centre, the compass points and the suburbs: <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">in the centre · in the north · in the suburbs</span>",
"<span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">on</span> مع الساحل: <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">on the east coast</span>": "<span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">on</span> with the coast: <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">on the east coast</span>",
"الجهات المركبة كلمة واحدة: <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">in the northwest · in the southeast</span>": "Compass points made of two parts are one word: <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">in the northwest · in the southeast</span>",
"<span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">commute</span> يتنقل يومياً من بيته إلى عمله، و <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">teleworker</span> من يعمل من بيته.": "<span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">commute</span> = travel every day from home to work, and a <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">teleworker</span> works from home.",
"مختبر مصغّر: أين المدينة؟": "Mini lab: where is the city?",
